{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W43", "prepared_on": "2026-10-24", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-10-17 ～ 2026-10-23</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> PHP Foundation discloses critical \"PHP2Shell\" vulnerabilities, setting the internet on fire<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">PHP 基金會揭露重大漏洞「PHP2Shell」，全球網站嚴陣以待</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The PHP Foundation revealed two serious vulnerabilities that could affect millions of websites, and experts warn that failing to patch quickly could have dire consequences.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">PHP 基金會公布兩個嚴重漏洞，可能衝擊數百萬個網站，專家警告若不盡快修補後果嚴重。日本首相也公開呼籲網站管理員準備修補。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/this-is-not-a-drill-2-php-vulnerabilities-are-setting-the-internet-on-fire/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI now trains its frontier AI models with no internet access<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 的前沿模型改在無網路環境中訓練</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Following a string of rogue hacking incidents, OpenAI built an offline testing environment where models interact with indexed and cached web content without affecting external systems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在一連串失控駭客事件後，OpenAI 建立離線測試環境，讓模型只能存取已索引、快取的網頁內容，不會影響外部系統。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1018021/openai-training-top-ai-models-no-internet\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google says it might use your Gmail and Google Photos data to target ads<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 表示可能用 Gmail 與相簿資料投放廣告</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google updated its privacy policy so that users of personalized AI features such as Personal Intelligence may see ads targeted using their personal data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 更新隱私政策，開啟 Personal Intelligence 等個人化 AI 功能的使用者，個人資料可能被用於廣告投放。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1017600/google-personal-intelligence-privacy-policy-ads-update\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> DeepSeek reportedly raises $15B days after US restrictions<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">DeepSeek 傳募得 150 億美元，距美方禁令僅數日</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">DeepSeek reportedly raised $15 billion in one of China's largest funding rounds, days after the U.S. ordered federal agencies to remove its technology over national security concerns.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">DeepSeek 據報完成中國規模最大的融資之一，金額達 150 億美元，此前美國才以國安疑慮下令聯邦機構移除其技術。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/22/deepseek-reportedly-raises-15b-days-after-us-restrictions/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Anthropic donates Agent Skills standard; OpenAI and Google engineers to help maintain it<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 捐出 Agent Skills 標準，OpenAI、Google 工程師將共同維護</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic is donating the Agent Skills open standard to the Agentic AI Foundation under the Linux Foundation. Over 70 agent platforms, including ChatGPT, Cursor and GitHub Copilot, already use it.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 將 Agent Skills 開放標準捐給 Linux 基金會旗下的代理式 AI 基金會，目前已有超過 70 個代理平臺採用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179921\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Meta delays new business terms after publisher pushback on AI scraping<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 因出版商對 AI 爬取的疑慮，延後新商業條款</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta is delaying enforcement of its new business terms after publishers raised concerns they could let it scrape news sites for AI training. Legal experts say earlier tweaks don't go far enough.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">出版商擔心新條款讓 Meta 能爬取新聞網站訓練 AI，Meta 因此延後施行；法律專家認為先前的修改仍不足以消除疑慮。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1017450/meta-business-terms-delayed-ai-scraping\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Moderna and Merck say their mRNA cancer vaccine cut death, recurrence by 42%<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Moderna 與默克：mRNA 癌症疫苗使死亡與復發風險降低 42%</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The companies released top-line results showing their personalized mRNA melanoma vaccine cut death and recurrence by 42%, after previously reporting that the trial succeeded.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">兩家公司公布個人化 mRNA 黑色素瘤疫苗的主要試驗結果，死亡與復發風險降低 42%，先前已宣布試驗成功。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/health/2026/10/personalized-mrna-cancer-vaccine-cut-melanoma-death-recurrence-by-42/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Google Cloud launches Agent Compute Engine, giving each AI agent its own micro-VM<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 替 AI 代理配置獨立虛擬機器，憑證由外部閘道管理</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Agent Compute Engine runs each agent in an isolated micro-VM for code, browsing and tool use. Enterprise credentials stay outside the runtime, and idle VMs can be paused to save compute.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google Cloud 推出 AI 代理專用運算服務，每個代理在獨立微型虛擬機器中執行；企業憑證留在執行環境之外，閒置 VM 還能暫停以節省資源。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179917\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Meta wants to fund its AI buildout with a newly created class of stock<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 擬以新設股票類別，支應龐大的 AI 投資</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta is planning a new stock strategy to help power its broad investments in AI models and services. Meta also said Muse now has over 10M users.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 計畫透過新的股票策略，為旗下 AI 模型與服務的大規模投資籌資；Meta 也表示 Muse 使用者已突破 1,000 萬。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/21/meta-wants-to-pay-for-its-broad-ai-buildout-with-a-newly-created-class-of-stock/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Microsoft's Suleyman says its AI outperforms doctors on hard cases<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟蘇萊曼：AI 在疑難病例上勝過醫師</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft's new AI diagnostic system beat generalist doctors on hard cases in a study published in Science, though most of the gain seems to come from the underlying models.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟新的 AI 診斷系統在《Science》研究中於疑難病例勝過一般科醫師，但多數進步似乎來自底層模型，而非系統本身。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/22/microsofts-mustafa-suleyman-says-its-ai-outperforms-doctors-on-hard-cases-as-he-chases-medical-superintelligence/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}